{"synopsis":"\\[Selamat datang di Murim Online, dunia tempat para terkuat berada.]\n\n\\[Perangkatmu mengalami kerusakan, dan keluar dari sistem gagal.]\n\n\\[Apakah kamu ingin mencoba untuk keluar sekali lagi?]\n\n\\[Ya atau Tidak]\n\nKetika dia mencoba kembali ke realitas virtual, tempat yang dia masuki justru adalah “Murim yang nyata.”\n\nSeorang psikopat yang muncul sekali dalam seabad jatuh ke dalam Murim karena kesalahan Sang Pencabut Nyawa.\n\nGigi tajam Dong Bongsu yang tanpa ampun membayangi Murim, yang penuh dengan intrik dan kebencian.","alternative_title":"Murim Psychopath, 싸이코패스 in 무림","author":"Gonbung, Kim Eon","artist":"Song Beom-Gyu","chapters":[{"number":"36","chapter":"36","slug":"ch_36","title":"Chapter 36","date":"2026-08-03"},{"number":"35","chapter":"35","slug":"ch_35","title":"Chapter 35","date":"2026-08-03"},{"number":"34","chapter":"34","slug":"ch_34","title":"Chapter 34","date":"2026-08-03"},{"number":"33","chapter":"33","slug":"ch_33","title":"Chapter 33","date":"2026-08-03"},{"number":"32","chapter":"32","slug":"ch_32","title":"Chapter 32","date":"2026-08-03"},{"number":"31","chapter":"31","slug":"ch_31","title":"Chapter 31","date":"2026-08-03"},{"number":"30","chapter":"30","slug":"ch_30","title":"Chapter 30","date":"2026-08-03"},{"number":"29","chapter":"29","slug":"ch_29","title":"Chapter 29","date":"2026-08-03"},{"number":"28","chapter":"28","slug":"ch_28","title":"Chapter 28","date":"2026-08-03"},{"number":"27","chapter":"27","slug":"ch_27","title":"Chapter 27","date":"2026-08-03"},{"number":"26","chapter":"26","slug":"ch_26","title":"Chapter 26","date":"2026-08-03"},{"number":"25","chapter":"25","slug":"ch_25","title":"Chapter 25","date":"2026-08-03"},{"number":"24","chapter":"24","slug":"ch_24","title":"Chapter 24","date":"2026-08-03"},{"number":"23","chapter":"23","slug":"ch_23","title":"Chapter 23","date":"2026-08-03"},{"number":"22","chapter":"22","slug":"ch_22","title":"Chapter 22","date":"2026-08-03"},{"number":"21","chapter"